<h2 id="4.-Part-A-%E2%80%94-Multi-Source-Personalized-PageRank">4. Part A — Multi-Source Personalized PageRank<a class="anchor-link" href="#4.-Part-A-%E2%80%94-Multi-Source-Personalized-PageRank">¶</a></h2>
